{"server":"tw","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_07_beg","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_07","title":"健康零食","storyCode":"DT-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ed8c708a1b638bb36872d3dabae824920d4ef85930ed57be21bdc76ac24b27a6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"誤以為被襲擊的萊歐斯小隊、認為萊歐斯小隊要搶劫的拓荒者們，和碰巧來此執行任務的羅德島幹員，三方人因為一群失控的無人機，被捲進同一場混亂中。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？為什麼這裡的魔法器具追著我們打？我們被誰盯上了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍碰不到它們，和之前對魔物的戰鬥都不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾！你用魔法啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我被炸到了……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳！能施展爆炸魔法和冰凍魔法，還能這麼精準地定位，這種魔法器具非常高級……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們動作太快了，很難瞄準……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……先跑！它們施魔法我就用魔法對衝！看看能不能跑出它們的攻擊範圍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那邊好像有村莊！這些東西也都是從那裡飛出來的，這次遇到的人對我們很不友好啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾！小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——我看到它們的軌跡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我……回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"炸彈被瑪露希爾施展的魔法擊飛，向著發射出它的無人機處飛去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人機被炸彈擊中，搖搖晃晃地掉落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一聲巨大的炸響，建築冒出火光，隨即響起的是村莊中人們大呼小叫的聲音。魔法器具隨著剛剛的爆炸，更加狂亂地衝向幾人。\n瑪露希爾不禁握緊了手中的法杖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，我們現在好像真的惹怒他們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先西，瑪露希爾，是時候該認真迎戰了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜……還是沒找到羅德島的消息……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，天災居然沒有毀掉我們的玉米地！這裡也沒有被沙塵暴侵襲，都好好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天我一直擔心害怕的，玉米地要是沒了我們下半年就沒得吃也沒得賣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，那我先去啟動無人機了？別的地方運氣可能沒我們這麼好，要是發現了我們這裡一點沒受損肯定會來搶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，記得調一下模式，別巡邏了，直接就是戰鬥模式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，記得接一下那個羅德島的幹員，他今天災後回訪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不對啊……基站怎麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……無人機怎麼也完全不聽指揮……？訊號……老大，老大！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——天、天災砸到了基站！無人機……失控了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別慌！先把基站停了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"關不掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞俚語*！那你自己想辦法啊！白養你的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！呃、呃，源石迴路……主線板……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——你們這什麼狀況？！這麼不歡迎我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是！小錘子瑞恩，我記得你！你幫幫我，無人機失控了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？你稍微躲起來，我來幫你看看……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——誰？真的有人來趁亂搶劫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹掉他們！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，任務記錄，這裡是瑞恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"首先是接回刻俄柏。呃……這個任務的難度有點高，情報顯示這孩子最後出現在這一帶，但是找起來可不簡單……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，今天也是災後回訪的第一天，去“玉米窩”看一下情況，希望一切順……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況？！拓荒地打起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！呃、呃，源石迴路……主線板……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（……沒看到外人？是他們自己內部出了問題？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（先試探一下吧……這群人都不是什麼好惹的……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——你們這什麼狀況？！這麼不歡迎我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是！小錘子瑞恩，我記得你！你幫幫我，無人機失控了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼……還好，只是無人機失控，要是拓荒地亂了我就完蛋在這裡了……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？你稍微躲起來，我來幫你看看……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳咳！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了，真是外面的拓荒者動手了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——誰？真的有人來趁亂搶劫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹掉他們！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，我在這要是被當成羅德島參與拓荒地紛爭可就完了，先、先保護住他們，最好能調節一下矛盾——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥別衝動！對面多少人還不知道，我們先找掩體躲起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*老子都看到了，就四個人！其中還有兩個矮子，打爆他們！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衝啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？就四個人？這什麼打劫組合？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……兩撥人？小心點，他們手裡都拿著武器，還有那種瑪露希爾都沒辦法對付的魔法器具，不要輕舉妄動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"氣死我了！我的頭髮都被炸亂了！我很喜歡這個編髮的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*以為老子是好惹的嗎？就四個人也敢炸我的糧倉？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不！等等！幾位有話好好說！無人機還在天上亂飛，真的要現在就打起來嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放屁！老子自己的無人機，還能把老子打死嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是他們什麼都不說，單方面地攻擊我們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敢來炸我的糧倉，找死——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們動手了，保護好自己，上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，這些魔法器具都是他們操控的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"唉呦……唉呦……都是老頑固，都勸不動啊……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"在荒野上打架不知道會引來什麼啊，大家先停下來，有話好好說不好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿是腳下的大地在這一刻聽到了他誠懇的祈求一般，地面突然發出劇烈的轟鳴。\n難道又是天災？這個念頭剛在幾人的腦中出現，隨即又被接下來的景象徹底擊碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一大群如浪潮般的鉗獸似乎是終於不想再忍受無人機在自己的頭頂狂轟濫炸，整齊地高舉著自己的雙鉗，直向眾人而來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——魔物群？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快跑！只有我們四個打不過的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有路了！牠們把我們包圍起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先往後退……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哎呀！誰不長眼撞老子？！老子一錘子——怎麼是你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，沒有路了，我們都被這群鉗獸包圍了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位，拜託了，聽我的吧，我們先一起對付牠們，好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"還、還有無人機！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
